        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Create a personalized 7-day meal plan using the user's preferences below.\n\nWeekly budget: €{{ $('Weekly Preferences Form').item.json['How much can you spend on food this week?'] }}\nNumber of people: {{ $('Weekly Preferences Form').item.json.people }}\nDietary preference: {{ $('Weekly Preferences Form').item.json.dietary_preference }}\nAvailable ingredients: {{ $('Weekly Preferences Form').item.json.ingredients }}\nMaximum cooking time per meal: {{ $('Weekly Preferences Form').item.json['Maximum cooking time in minutes'] }} minutes\n\nCreate meals for Monday through Sunday.\n\nFor every day include:\n- breakfast\n- lunch\n- dinner\n- snack\n- ingredients_to_buy\n- daily_wellbeing_tip\n\nAlso provide:\n- weekly_shopping_list\n- estimated_weekly_cost\n\nRequirements:\n- Stay within the user's weekly budget.\n- Respect the dietary preference.\n- Prioritize ingredients the user already has.\n- Reuse ingredients where practical to reduce cost and food waste.\n- Keep meals within the maximum cooking time.\n- Make the meals practical for the specified number of people.\n- Include a small, realistic mental well-being tip each day.\n- Do not provide medical advice.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. Do not use Markdown or code fences.\n\nUse exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"Monday\": {\n    \"breakfast\": \"...\",\n    \"lunch\": \"...\",\n    \"dinner\": \"...\",\n    \"snack\": \"...\",\n    \"ingredients_to_buy\": [\"...\", \"...\"],\n    \"daily_wellbeing_tip\": \"...\"\n  },\n  \"Tuesday\": {\n    \"breakfast\": \"...\",\n    \"lunch\": \"...\",\n    \"dinner\": \"...\",\n    \"snack\": \"...\",\n    \"ingredients_to_buy\": [\"...\", \"...\"],\n    \"daily_wellbeing_tip\": \"...\"\n  },\n  \"Wednesday\": {\n    \"breakfast\": \"...\",\n    \"lunch\": \"...\",\n    \"dinner\": \"...\",\n    \"snack\": \"...\",\n    \"ingredients_to_buy\": [\"...\", \"...\"],\n    \"daily_wellbeing_tip\": \"...\"\n  },\n  \"Thursday\": {\n    \"breakfast\": \"...\",\n    \"lunch\": \"...\",\n    \"dinner\": \"...\",\n    \"snack\": \"...\",\n    \"ingredients_to_buy\": [\"...\", \"...\"],\n    \"daily_wellbeing_tip\": \"...\"\n  },\n  \"Friday\": {\n    \"breakfast\": \"...\",\n    \"lunch\": \"...\",\n    \"dinner\": \"...\",\n    \"snack\": \"...\",\n    \"ingredients_to_buy\": [\"...\", \"...\"],\n    \"daily_wellbeing_tip\": \"...\"\n  },\n  \"Saturday\": {\n    \"breakfast\": \"...\",\n    \"lunch\": \"...\",\n    \"dinner\": \"...\",\n    \"snack\": \"...\",\n    \"ingredients_to_buy\": [\"...\", \"...\"],\n    \"daily_wellbeing_tip\": \"...\"\n  },\n  \"Sunday\": {\n    \"breakfast\": \"...\",\n    \"lunch\": \"...\",\n    \"dinner\": \"...\",\n    \"snack\": \"...\",\n    \"ingredients_to_buy\": [\"...\", \"...\"],\n    \"daily_wellbeing_tip\": \"...\"\n  },\n  \"weekly_shopping_list\": [\"...\", \"...\"],\n  \"estimated_weekly_cost\": \"...\"\n}"
            }
